{"tmdb":1620525,"tagline":"","synopsis":"In a storm-scared village, 70-year-old Tae lives a quiet life until she rescues Haru, a mysterious mountain creature. As she feeds and nurtures him with her wanzi, she finds a renewed sense of purpose. However, when rumors of a monster spread, fear turns the villagers against them. Tae is forcibly hospitalized, and Haru is hunted as a harbinger of disaster. To protect him, she stages a fake funeral. When a new storm strikes, Tae must learn that love is not possession but letting go.","directors":[{"name":"Akira Ikeda","id":1288192}],"cast":[{"actor":"Kimiko Yo","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/g1NZGtCzJKpqgdjNbNYaKBPyYRw.jpg","tmdb":80864},{"actor":"Joe Odagiri","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jjbwOodtQeVcTwO9oUbLOGjjHDP.jpg","tmdb":63694},{"actor":"Liu Kuan-Ting","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eOlDORhsEULVhKpJLK5YYnR8mLW.jpg","tmdb":2386927},{"actor":"Tou Tsung-hua","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pLbLftVzy5A1BkYlET2gb563WeV.jpg","tmdb":1366128},{"actor":"Patty Wu","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eELX2ekg9Yc5w8uELH2fVYYYbKY.jpg","tmdb":3736022},{"actor":"Sun Ke-fang","role":"","photo":null,"tmdb":2289091},{"actor":"Apple Chen","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rzCPFtMrR4vZO3ORojPk3gJbKTj.jpg","tmdb":2896620},{"actor":"Chen Yao-an","role":"","photo":null,"tmdb":6002352},{"actor":"Leo Wang","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A94Df1yRo6i5LH7wKoE0tk8tpC4.jpg","tmdb":2894289},{"actor":"Hsieh Yu-wei","role":"","photo":null,"tmdb":581762}],"trailers":[{"key":"esnxv1ZN9L4","name":"2026 Golden Horse Film Festival TGHFF | My Dear Monster Child: The Canary's Lullaby","type":"Trailer","published":"2026-10-12"}],"official":null,"watch":{},"artwork":{"posters":[["/mn6nfBD3ZZCEUh9YQFtI8RCybvx.jpg",2000,3000],["/bYbbTtp2nikHHpD7JRczPglTKso.jpg",1413,2000],["/ifKnQD8S155wO1SAOt1mjKmRfNb.jpg",843,1264]],"backdrops":[